{"page":167,"verses":[{"verse_key":"7:138","surah":7,"ayah":138,"ar_uthmani":"وَجَـٰوَزْنَا بِبَنِىٓ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ ٱلْبَحْرَ فَأَتَوْا۟ عَلَىٰ قَوْمٍ يَعْكُفُونَ عَلَىٰٓ أَصْنَامٍ لَّهُمْ ۚ قَالُوا۟ يَـٰمُوسَى ٱجْعَل لَّنَآ إِلَـٰهًا كَمَا لَهُمْ ءَالِهَةٌ ۚ قَالَ إِنَّكُمْ قَوْمٌ تَجْهَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We took the Children of Israel across the sea, but when they came upon a people who worshipped idols, they said, ‘Moses, make a god for us like theirs.’ He said, ‘You really are foolish people:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَجَـٰوَزْنَا","en_gloss":"And We led across","transliteration":"wajāwaznā","verse_key":"7:138"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِبَنِىٓ","en_gloss":"(the) Children","transliteration":"bibanī","verse_key":"7:138"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","en_gloss":"(of) Israel","transliteration":"is'rāīla","verse_key":"7:138"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْبَحْرَ","en_gloss":"the sea","transliteration":"l-baḥra","verse_key":"7:138"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَأَتَوْا۟","en_gloss":"Then they came","transliteration":"fa-ataw","verse_key":"7:138"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"upon","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"7:138"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قَوْمٍۢ","en_gloss":"a people","transliteration":"qawmin","verse_key":"7:138"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَعْكُفُونَ","en_gloss":"devoted","transliteration":"yaʿkufūna","verse_key":"7:138"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَلَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"7:138"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَصْنَامٍۢ","en_gloss":"idols","transliteration":"aṣnāmin","verse_key":"7:138"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَّهُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"of theirs","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"7:138"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"They said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"7:138"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَـٰمُوسَى","en_gloss":"O Musa","transliteration":"yāmūsā","verse_key":"7:138"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱجْعَل","en_gloss":"Make","transliteration":"ij'ʿal","verse_key":"7:138"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لَّنَآ","en_gloss":"for us","transliteration":"lanā","verse_key":"7:138"},{"pos":16,"ar":"إِلَـ