transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","verse_key":"7:139"},{"pos":11,"ar":"١٣٩","en_gloss":"(139)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:139"}]},{"verse_key":"7:140","surah":7,"ayah":140,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ أَغَيْرَ ٱللَّهِ أَبْغِيكُمْ إِلَـٰهًا وَهُوَ فَضَّلَكُمْ عَلَى ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Why should I seek any god other than God for you, when He has favoured you over all other people?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"7:140"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَغَيْرَ","en_gloss":"Should other than","transliteration":"aghayra","verse_key":"7:140"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"7:140"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَبْغِيكُمْ","en_gloss":"I seek for you","transliteration":"abghīkum","verse_key":"7:140"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَـٰهًۭا","en_gloss":"a god","transliteration":"ilāhan","verse_key":"7:140"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"while He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"7:140"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَضَّلَكُمْ","en_gloss":"has preferred you","transliteration":"faḍḍalakum","verse_key":"7:140"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"over","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"7:140"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","en_gloss":"the worlds","transliteration":"l-ʿālamīna","verse_key":"7:140"},{"pos":10,"ar":"١٤٠","en_gloss":"(140)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:140"}]},{"verse_key":"7:141","surah":7,"ayah":141,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذْ أَنجَيْنَـٰكُم مِّنْ ءَالِ فِرْعَوْنَ يَسُومُونَكُمْ سُوٓءَ ٱلْعَذَابِ ۖ يُقَتِّلُونَ أَبْنَآءَكُمْ وَيَسْتَحْيُونَ نِسَآءَكُمْ ۚ وَفِى ذَٰلِكُم بَلَآءٌ مِّن رَّبِّكُمْ عَظِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Remember how We saved you from Pharaoh’s people, who were subjecting you to the worst of sufferings, killing your male children, sparing only your females- that was a mighty ordeal from your Lord.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذْ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idh","verse_key":"7:141"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنجَيْنَـٰكُم","en_gloss":"We s